    {
      "id": "r20261116-a02",
      "title": "Digital Detox: Taking a Break from Screens",
      "level": "Menengah",
      "min": 3,
      "body": [
        "How many hours did you spend on your phone yesterday? For many people, the answer is more than six. Some of them are now trying a digital detox: a planned break from screens.",
        "A digital detox can last one evening or a whole weekend. During this time, people turn off notifications and keep their phones in another room. They read paper books, cook, walk, or simply talk with family and friends.",
        "People who try it often say they sleep better and feel less worried. Scientists agree that too much screen time, especially before bed, can hurt sleep. You do not have to throw your phone away. Just start small: one screen-free hour every day can already make a difference."
      ],
      "gloss": {
        "spend": "menghabiskan",
        "notifications": "notifikasi",
        "another room": "ruangan lain",
        "worried": "cemas",
        "screen time": "waktu di depan layar",
        "hurt": "mengganggu",
        "throw away": "membuang",
        "difference": "perbedaan"
      },
      "qs": [
        {
          "q": "What is a digital detox?",
          "opts": [
            "A new phone application",
            "A kind of computer game",
            "A planned break from screens"
          ],
